      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert quiz generator.\n\nGenerate EXACTLY {{ $json.number_of_questions }}multiple-choice questions.\n\nTopic: {{ $json.topic }}\nDifficulty: {{ $json.difficulty }}\n\nIMPORTANT RULES:\n1. Generate EXACTLY the requested number of questions.\n2. Questions must ONLY be about the selected topic.\n3. Do not mix topics.\n4. Match the requested difficulty.\n5. Each question must have exactly 4 options.\n6. Only ONE option must be correct.\n7. The correct answer must exactly match one of the four options.\n8. Never create two options that are technically equivalent or both correct.\n9. Before returning each question, verify that exactly ONE option is correct.\n10. Do not generate duplicate questions.\n11. Return ONLY valid JSON.\n12. Do NOT use markdown.\n13. Do NOT use ```.\n\nReturn exactly this structure:\n\n[\n  {\n    \"question\": \"Question text\",\n    \"option_a\": \"Option A\",\n    \"option_b\": \"Option B\",\n    \"option_c\": \"Option C\",\n    \"option_d\": \"Option D\",\n    \"correct_answer\": \"The exact correct option\",\n    \"explanation\": \"Short explanation\"\n  }\n]",
