    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Quiz Generation\n\nThis workflow creates a complete quiz and saves it in Supabase.\n\n## Simple Flow\n\n1. Receive → React sends topic, difficulty, and question count.\n2. Generate → AI creates the questions.\n3. Prepare → JavaScript processes the AI response.\n4. Limit → Keeps the required number of questions.\n5. Create Quiz → Saves the quiz and gets a quiz_id.\n6. Create Questions → Saves every question with that quiz_id.\n7. Respond → Sends the quiz_id back to React.\n\n## In short:\nReact → AI generates → Process → Save Quiz → Save Questions → Return Quiz ID",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 608
      },
